    "Initially, the hotel had \\(105\\) guests.\n\n- \\(26\\) guests checked out:  \n  \\[\n  105-26=79\n  \\]\n- \\(7\\) guests checked in after dinner and are included in the current total:  \n  \\[\n  79+7=86\n  \\]\n\nTherefore, the hotel’s current guest total is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{86\\text{ guests}}\n\\]",
