    "Start with the original 105 guests:\n\n\\[\n105-26+7=86\n\\]\n\nThe hotel’s fee information does not change the guest count. Therefore, the hotel currently has\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{86\\text{ guests}}\n\\]"
